    "title": "Project Update - PINK - Nov 14th 2025",
    "body": "Executive Summary\n\nWe’ve made the app faster, more stable, and more interactive. Ads and Home sections (Sale, New, Hot) now update in real-time. Admin controls are improved, and documentation/release notes are up to date. Next, we’ll start building the payment system.\n\nHighlights Delivered\n\nReal-time Data\nAds and Home sections now update automatically—no manual refresh needed.\nOnly changes are sent to the app to save data and improve speed.\nAdmin Controls\nItems can be marked as Sale, New, or Hot (one category per item).\nChanges made by admins update instantly for all users.\n\nPerformance & Stability\n\nSmoother scrolling and swiping.\nImages load faster using caching and preloading.\nFixed minor bugs that could cause crashes.\nReduced unnecessary network calls.\n\nOffline Readiness\nCached items, sizes, and colors allow the app to start faster and work better with poor internet.\n\nDocumentation & Release\nReal-time Home sections integration guide added.\nServer playbook and release notes updated (v2.2.0).\n\nWhat’s Next\nMonitor swipe performance and tweak layouts if needed.\nStart payment system setup with a secure server-first approach.\nOnly call third-party APIs from the client if necessary.\n\nPlease review the \"Screenshots section to see all up-to-date screenshots of the project\"",
